# Exception: __main__.py is NOT a temp script
!src/mcptoon/__main__.py
# 2026-10-02 事故：上面 `_*.py` 把 `src/mcptoon/_toon/__init__.py` 一并吃掉了，于是
# v0.8.6 少打一个文件进 wheel，`mcptoon --version` 直接 ImportError（PyPI 上已坏）。
# 包目录的前导下划线是包名的一部分，不是临时脚本 —— 名字带下划线的包要显式放行。
!src/mcptoon/_toon/

# Scratch workspace: task briefs, probe scripts and throwaway venvs. Nothing
# here ships, and it only ever showed up as untracked noise in `git status`.
.scratch/

# Old README versions
readme-v*.md
readme-preview*.html

# Unfinished README rewrites (marketing drafts, not for the public repo).
# 2026-09-18: four full README rewrites sat untracked in the working tree and
# kept `git status` noisy. A rewrite is not a shipping artifact until it is
# applied to README.md itself; until then it is scratch, like readme-v*.md above.
README.*-draft*.md
# 2026-09-22: the drafts also used `.vN` / `.proposed` naming, which the glob
# above missed, so they showed up as 20 phantom "new files" in `git status`.
# Enumerated so the real README.md / README.zh-CN.md stay tracked.
README.v*.md
README.zh-CN.v*.md
README.proposed.md
README.zh-CN.proposed.md
# 2026-09-27: the same draft pattern applies to DEVELOPERS.md — a stale v6 draft
# (v0.7.21 / 1254 tests / 27 modules) sat untracked and would ship wrong numbers.
DEVELOPERS.v*.md
readme_preview*.html

